  "description": "XIVZAE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H94 Er4 N50 O38 4+,5(H3 O1 1+),9(Cl1 1-),35(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1B (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2B (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.590-3.779 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.94-109.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H179Cl9Er4N50O78.",
